{"a":[1,4],"h":"<div class=\"em-intro\"><p>«<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"25\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 25.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » Sûresi Mekkidir, bir ismi de sûrei Davuddur (Besair).</p><p>Âyetleri - Kûfîde seksen, Hicazî, Bısrî, Şamîde seksen altıdır.</p><p>Kelimeleri - Yedi yüz otuz ikidir.</p><p>Harfleri - Üç bin altmış dokuzdur.</p><p>Fasılası -<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"134\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 133.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 15.0 31.4 42.0 57.7 74.2 81.7 92.2 108.0 117.0\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> harfleridir.</p><p>Evvelki Sûrenin âhirine doğru « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"436\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 436.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 13.4 20.2 20.2 34.4 41.2 41.2 54.0 54.0 63.0 63.0 70.4 86.2 86.2 93.0 93.0 93.0 99.7 107.2 123.0 130.4 137.2 144.0 144.0 162.0 168.7 168.7 175.4 175.4 187.4 204.0 215.2 215.2 225.7 232.4 232.4 240.0 240.0 248.2 252.7 260.2 276.0 286.4 286.4 302.2 309.0 309.0 316.4 316.4 327.7 327.7 344.2 351.0 357.7 366.7 366.7 373.4 373.4 391.4 391.4 402.0 417.7 417.7 426.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"3.0 34.4 123.0 137.2 168.7 187.4 215.2 240.0 248.2 276.0 351.0 357.7 391.4 402.0 426.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> » hikâye buyurulduğu için bu Sûre de «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"169\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 169.1 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 3.0 3.0 10.6 10.6 21.7 21.7 21.7 30.7 38.3 54.0 67.6 67.6 84.0 84.0 94.6 94.6 101.3 101